FOR SALE: A UNIQUE AND ELEGANT APARTMENT IN POSTMODERN MINIMALIST STYLE WITH HIGH CEILINGS IN THE VERY HEART OF VILNIUS – THE OLD TOWN!

Designed by Another Studios, this apartment features a unique interior that will leave no one indifferent and stands out from typical contemporary home designs. The space combines custom niche furniture with high-quality household appliances, ensuring premium living conditions and offering a sustainable long-term investment opportunity.
Every detail of the apartment has been thoughtfully considered: grand double doors, a cozy balcony, two walk-in wardrobes, distinctive home décor, and ornamental ceiling moldings create a warm and stylish atmosphere. This home is an excellent example of contemporary eclectic design, blending elements of art, design, and architecture.

Located in a prestigious area of Vilnius, in the top-tier Old Town, where convenience, comfort, and urban rhythm merge, this apartment is an ideal choice for those who value high-quality living and want to reside near the city’s most important landmarks.
Living in this prestigious part of Vilnius will immerse you in the spirit of the Old Town – you’ll always be close to the city’s heart. Popular attractions, art galleries, restaurants, bars, and the charming Reformatų Square are all nearby, making every day rich with urban energy and unique discoveries.
